{"id":"20260825T182338.529105792Z-c7ab6369","time":"2026-08-25T18:23:38.529105792Z","session_id":"session-20260825T181749.937712941Z","task_id":"task-1787681869938101277","source":"sensei","kind":"change.reported","summary":"Architectural change report\n  for: internal/decision sends a decision to the sensei CLI whenever it names an invariant OR any source file. Sensei's own contract-first rule is narrower: a decision must connect to a governing invariant or a failure mode, and naming the files it touched is not a connection. So an unlinkable decision is sent to be refused, and the user learns about it as a tool error rather than as a statement about their decision.\n\nAdd a Failures []string field to Record, carried to Sensei as --related-failure per non-empty entry, the way Invariants is already carried as --related-invariant.\n\nValidate must return the exported ErrNotLinked when a record links to neither an invariant nor a failure -- source files alone no longer satisfy it -- and Write must return that without invoking the CLI at all. A record missing a title or rationale is still invalid, and that is not an unlinked decision.\n\n  files: 1 added, 1 modified, 0 deleted\n  go: 1 source, 1 test\n\n  governed by:\n    Recorded knowledge enters a review queue and never the live graph\n\n  Sensei risk class: ARCHITECTURE_SENSITIVE\n\n  Sensei diff audit:\n    schema: awareness.diff_audit/v1\n    decision: pass\n    availability: available\n    input_trust: caller_supplied\n    digest: 489e7fb80c7c2ffe07af51863cb709cc9b0c60822ddde574f626482a77cf826f\n    changed_files_count: 2\n    findings_count: 0\n    \n    No blocking findings found in supplied diff.\n\n  not established by this report:\n    - admission: not requested, so this candidate is not admitted\n    - correctness: reviewer acceptance is not proof, and passing tests are not proof","payload":{"files":[{"path":"internal/decision/record.go","status":"modified"},{"path":"internal/decision/record_test.go","status":"added"}],"audit":"schema: awareness.diff_audit/v1\ndecision: pass\navailability: available\ninput_trust: caller_supplied\ndigest: 489e7fb80c7c2ffe07af51863cb709cc9b0c60822ddde574f626482a77cf826f\nchanged_files_count: 2\nfindings_count: 0\n\nNo blocking findings found in supplied diff.","risk":"ARCHITECTURE_SENSITIVE","governing":["Recorded knowledge enters a review queue and never the live graph"]}}
