{"id":"20260825T182338.574843807Z-91e58e9a","time":"2026-08-25T18:23:38.574843807Z","session_id":"session-20260825T181749.937712941Z","task_id":"task-1787681869938101277","source":"system","kind":"workflow.completed","summary":"candidate ready for governed admission","payload":{"audit":"schema: awareness.diff_audit/v1\ndecision: pass\navailability: available\ninput_trust: caller_supplied\ndigest: 489e7fb80c7c2ffe07af51863cb709cc9b0c60822ddde574f626482a77cf826f\nchanged_files_count: 2\nfindings_count: 0\n\nNo blocking findings found in supplied diff.","implementor":"claude","plan":"Extend decision records with failure-mode links, emit each non-empty failure through Sensei's --related-failure argument, and reject records lacking a non-empty invariant or failure before any CLI lookup or execution. Preserve title-and-rationale validation precedence and keep source files as metadata only.","publication":"not_offered","review":"Candidate satisfies the plan. Sensei’s current authoritative briefing identifies the critical invariant “Recorded knowledge enters a review queue and never the live graph”; the candidate preserves --no-rebuild, retains validation before CLI lookup/execution, and changes linkage semantics to non-empty invariant or failure links only. The supplied exact-revision test, vet, build, and formatting evidence passed.","workspace":"/tmp/proofbench/proof-v5/internal-decision-6cf23e8/COLD/.1-worktrees/task-1787681869938101277"}}